   "]"}]], "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellID->293603440],

Cell["\<\
===================== concatenation (einx `+` on RHS) =============\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->41556351],

Cell["\<\
1. Scalar append 'b c, -> b (c + 1)' with scalar 42 (SPEC ex4)
=== native Join of x and a constant column.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->212810967],

