Cell["\<\
===================== composite summands (concat) ===============\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->785311693],

Cell["\<\
A direct-sum summand may be a product block (a CircleTimes), e.g. (a\
\[CircleTimes]b) \[CirclePlus] c.
Supported in BOTH directions: concat here, and split below (the CAS matcher
solveComposite resolves the block's factor sizes; see SPEC \[Section]9).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->114490889],

Cell["\<\
24. Composite block whose operand is pre-merged: 'm (a b), m c -> m ((a b) + \
c)', a=2.\
