Cell["\<\
10b. A name repeated *within a single operand* ('a' in operand 1) is \
within-tensor
contraction \[LongDash] Dot contracts *across* operands, not within one, so \
it is rejected (Dot's
own policy; EinstoffShapes no longer gates it).  'b' is a legitimate \
cross-operand
contracted axis and must NOT trip the guard (firstDuplicateAxis is per-shape).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->941307268],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Quiet", "[",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Einstoff", "[", "Dot", "]"}], "[",
