Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Einsum.wlt", "Section",
 CellID->389463582],

Cell["\<\
Tests for Einstoff[\"einsum\"] \[LongDash] the pairwise-contraction subset of \
einsum.
Within-tensor contraction (repeated dropped index) for one tensor, cross-tensor
contraction for several.  Validated against native WL (TensorContract / Tr / \
Dot);
einops.einsum / np.einsum cross-validation lives in tests/python/Einsum.wlt.
Run via: wolframscript -script scripts/run-tests.wls\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->393629148],

