Cell["\<\
14. A Pattern-form binding key `r_ -> n` is a category error (a matcher, not \
an axis
name) \[LongDash] rejected, not silently ignored (which would let a \
whole-axis blank be
\"bound\" and still succeed by tensor inference).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->377095975],

