Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Map.wlt", "Section",
 CellID->95551359],

Cell["\<\
Tests for the map lowering path (Einstoff[Map]) \[LongDash] einx \
miscellaneous /
shape-preserving elementary ops (flip/roll/sort/softmax/log_softmax/id).
The op is curried: Einstoff[Map][f][desc, tensors, bindings]; f is a
vector->vector function, or a string shortcut for the einx op of that name.
The targeted axes are the op axes (kept on the output); every
untargeted axis is vmapped.  One file per lowering path under tests/.
Run via: wolframscript -script scripts/run-tests.wls
BeginTestSection/EndTestSection are MUnit markers; the runner loads MUnit`.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->37461951],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Einstoff`Lowering`Map", "Subsection",
 CellID->600344406],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[",
  RowBox[{"a", ",", "b", ",", "c", ",", "r"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellID->461427643],

Cell["\<\
1. Flip (einx.flip) by name: reverse along the targeted axis.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->52451335],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{",
    RowBox[{"x", "=",
     RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Range", "[", "8", "]"}], ",",
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"2", ",", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Einstoff", "[", "Map", "]"}], "[", "\"\<flip\>\"", "]"}], "[",
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"a_", ",", "#b"}], "}"}], "}"}], "\[RuleDelayed]",
      RowBox[{"{",
       RowBox[{"{",
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "#b"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], ",",
     RowBox[{"{", "x", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "VerificationTest",
